================================================================================
DATA (cities/*.json, region_seeds.json, previews/*.html)
Open Database License (ODbL) v1.0
================================================================================

Most region boundaries are derived from OpenStreetMap data, which is
(c) OpenStreetMap contributors and available under the Open Database
License: https://opendatabase.org/ (full text at
https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/).

Some cities are derived from official municipal open data instead. Each
file in cities/ records its own source, license, and attribution in its
"source" block. Where a city's source is municipal open data, that
city's data is available under the license named in its source block,
with the attribution given there.
